<title>UK: CNA sets 2.5 billion French franc bond.</title>
<headline>CNA sets 2.5 billion French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE NATIONALE DES AUTOROUTES</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    24.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.428   PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    101.478   SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
